msgstr "Supermodel 设置 - 音频"

msgid "Sound volume"
msgstr "音效音量"

msgid ""
"Choose the master volume in percentage, between 0% to 100%. Default is 100%."
msgstr "选择主音量百分比，范围为 0% 到 100%。默认值为 100%。"

